---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="FAQ">
  <div class="faq">
    <div class="head-h">
      <h1>FAQ</h1>
      <span class="flourish" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></span>
    </div>
    <p class="eyebrow">The personal questions, answered once.</p>
    <p class="intro">A standing page for the things people tend to ask.</p>

    <details class="qa" open>
      <summary>What do I work on? <span class="ic">+</span></summary>
      <div class="a">I work on durable professional themes: generative media and computer vision. I'm currently a Research Engineer at Dashtoon.</div>
    </details>
    <details class="qa">
      <summary>What do I write about here? <span class="ic">+</span></summary>
      <div class="a">I write dev logs, experiments, side quests, and occasional thoughts.</div>
    </details>
    <details class="qa">
      <summary>Why is the site called ayvbrg.log? <span class="ic">+</span></summary>
      <div class="a">
        ayvbrg is a compressed form of Ayushman Buragohain; <code>.log</code> is the
        ongoing record.
      </div>
    </details>
    <details class="qa">
      <summary>What am I curious about? <span class="ic">+</span></summary>
      <div class="a">I'm curious about generative image/video, computer vision, developer tools and agent-assisted workflows, and game development with Godot. Starwater is a concrete example of learning Godot from zero.</div>
    </details>
    <details class="qa">
      <summary>How can I follow new Entries? <span class="ic">+</span></summary>
      <div class="a">
        I follow new Entries via <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>.
      </div>
    </details>
    <details class="qa">
      <summary>How can I report an error or contact you? <span class="ic">+</span></summary>
      <div class="a">
        You can reach me at <a href="mailto:aburagohain160@gmail.com">aburagohain160@gmail.com</a>, and check the verified profiles: <a href="https://github.com/ayvbrg">ayvbrg</a> on GitHub and <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ayushman-buragohain">ayushman-buragohain</a> on LinkedIn.
      </div>
    </details>
    <details class="qa">
      <summary>Do I revise older Entries? <span class="ic">+</span></summary>
      <div class="a">Yes. When I make material revisions, the entry gets an Updated date.</div>
    </details>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
